%I A296777 #12 Oct 28 2026 10:17:50
%S A296777 6348,126016,2022480
%N A296777 Detour index of the n-cube-connected cycle graph.
%C A296777 The n-cube-connected cycle graph is Hamilton-connected for odd n, giving the formula below. In particular, a(7) = 358859200 and a(9) = 48901130496.
%H A296777 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Cube-ConnectedCycleGraph.html">Cube-Connected Cycle Graph</a>.
%H A296777 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/DetourIndex.html">Detour Index</a>.
%H A296777 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Hamilton-ConnectedGraph.html">Hamilton-Connected Graph</a>.
%F A296777 a(n) = 2^(n - 1)*n*(2^n*n - 1)^2 for odd n >= 3.
%K A296777 nonn,more,changed
%O A296777 3,1
%A A296777 _Eric W. Weisstein_, Dec 20 2017
